{"seq":1,"slug":"sequential-model-based","title":"序贯模型优化（SMBO）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/bayesian-optimization-hyperparameter/algorithms/sequential-model-based","wordCount":1644,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"序贯模型优化-smbo\">序贯模型优化（SMBO）</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>SMBO 主循环</strong>：初始化 → 拟合代理模型 → 优化采集函数 → 评估 → 更新数据 → 迭代</li>\n<li><strong>初始化与收敛</strong>：Latin Hypercube / Sobol 序列覆盖空间，EI 值衰减信号收敛</li>\n<li><strong>变体谱系</strong>：EGO（GP+EI 经典）、SMAC（随机森林 + 条件空间）、异步 SMBO（幻想观测）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"smbo-的主循环结构\">SMBO 的主循环结构</h2><p>序贯模型优化（Sequential Model-Based Optimization, SMBO）是贝叶斯优化的标准实现框架。它将<a href=\"../foundations/surrogate-model-gp\">代理模型</a>与<a href=\"../foundations/acquisition-functions\">采集函数</a>组合成一个迭代闭环：每轮用已有数据拟合代理模型，优化采集函数选出下一个评估点，执行评估并将结果加入数据集，然后进入下一轮。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[初始化: 随机采样 n0 个点] --&gt; B[拟合代理模型 M]&#10;    B --&gt; C[优化采集函数 alpha]&#10;    C --&gt; D[选择下一评估点 x_next]&#10;    D --&gt; E[评估目标函数 y = f x_next + noise]&#10;    E --&gt; F[更新数据集 D = D + x_next y]&#10;    F --&gt; G{预算用尽?}&#10;    G --&gt;|否| B&#10;    G --&gt;|是| H[返回最优观测 x_best]\">graph TD\n    A[初始化: 随机采样 n0 个点] --&gt; B[拟合代理模型 M]\n    B --&gt; C[优化采集函数 alpha]\n    C --&gt; D[选择下一评估点 x_next]\n    D --&gt; E[评估目标函数 y = f x_next + noise]\n    E --&gt; F[更新数据集 D = D + x_next y]\n    F --&gt; G{预算用尽?}\n    G --&gt;|否| B\n    G --&gt;|是| H[返回最优观测 x_best]</pre><p>这个看似简单的循环隐藏了多个设计选择，每个选择都显著影响优化效果。</p>\n<h2 id=\"初始化策略\">初始化策略</h2><p>初始观测的质量决定了代理模型的起始信念是否合理。</p>\n<p><strong>初始采样方法比较</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>空间覆盖性</th>\n<th>确定性</th>\n<th>维度扩展性</th>\n<th>推荐场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>均匀随机</td>\n<td>一般</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>好</td>\n<td>维度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d &gt; 20</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Latin Hypercube (LHS)</td>\n<td>好</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>好</td>\n<td>默认首选</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Sobol 序列</td>\n<td>优秀</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>中等（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>40</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d &lt; 40</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">40</span></span></span></span></span>）</td>\n<td>中低维精确优化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>正交阵列</td>\n<td>优秀</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>差（高维组合爆炸）</td>\n<td>低维因子实验</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>初始点数的经验规则：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>d</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>10</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_0 = \\max(2d, 10)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 为搜索空间维度。Ax 默认使用 Sobol 序列生成初始 trial，Optuna 在 GP 模型启动前也先收集一定数量的随机 trial。</p>\n<p>过少的初始点会导致 GP 的核超参数估计不可靠（特别是长度尺度可能被严重错估）；过多则浪费预算在无模型指导的随机探索上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"代理模型的拟合与更新\">代理模型的拟合与更新</h2><p>SMBO 每轮都需要重新拟合代理模型。对 GP 而言，这意味着：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>优化核超参数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span>（最大化边缘似然或后验）</li>\n<li>计算 Cholesky 分解 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{L}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">L</span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">K</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">I</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">L</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⊤</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{K} + \\sigma_n^2\\mathbf{I} = \\mathbf{L}\\mathbf{L}^\\top</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7694em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">K</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0611em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">L</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">⊤</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）</li>\n<li>预计算 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">α</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">L</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⊤</mi></mrow></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">L</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol{\\alpha} = \\mathbf{L}^{-\\top}\\mathbf{L}^{-1}\\mathbf{y}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord boldsymbol\">α</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0435em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">⊤</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\" style=\"margin-right:0.016em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span> 用于后续预测</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>增量更新 vs 完全重拟合</strong>：每加入一个新观测后，可通过秩一更新避免重新 Cholesky 分解（从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^3)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 降到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>）。但核超参数仍需定期重新优化——通常每隔 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 步做一次完整拟合，中间步骤只做增量更新。</p>\n<p><strong>模型选择与集成</strong>：SMAC 使用随机森林作为代理模型，天然处理条件超参数（参数 A 只在参数 B 取某值时存在）。实践中可用模型集成——GP + 随机森林加权平均——结合两者优势。</p>\n<h2 id=\"采集函数优化的工程细节\">采集函数优化的工程细节</h2><p>采集函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha(\\mathbf{x})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 维非凸函数。在 SMBO 的每一轮中，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 的全局最大值必须被可靠地找到。</p>\n<p>BoTorch 的默认策略（被 Ax 继承）：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>从 Sobol 序列生成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>raw</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>512</mn><mo>×</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{\\text{raw}} = 512 \\times d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">raw</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">512</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 个候选点</li>\n<li>在候选点上评估 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span>，选 top-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k = 20</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span></span></span></span></span>）作为 L-BFGS-B 的起点</li>\n<li>多起点并行 L-BFGS-B 优化，取全局最优</li>\n</ol>\n<p>对混合空间（含离散变量），Optuna 的 TPE 通过密度比优化采集（无需梯度），对离散变量天然友好。</p>\n<h2 id=\"smbo-变体-ego-与-smac\">SMBO 变体：EGO 与 SMAC</h2><p>**EGO（Efficient Global Optimization）**是 SMBO 的经典实例化：GP 代理 + EI 采集 + L-BFGS 优化。Jones et al. (1998) 的原始论文奠定了整个领域。EGO 适用于连续、低维（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d \\leq 10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8304em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span>）、无噪声的黑箱优化。</p>\n<p>**SMAC（Sequential Model-based Algorithm Configuration）**将 EGO 扩展到高维混合空间：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>代理模型改用随机森林（处理条件参数和类别变量）</li>\n<li>采集函数采用 EI，但用随机森林的分位数回归估计不确定性</li>\n<li>初始设计包含&quot;默认配置&quot;（利用先验知识）</li>\n<li>支持实例化特征（instance features）——同一配置在多个问题实例上的表现</li>\n</ul>\n<p>SMAC 在算法配置（algorithm configuration）场景中广泛使用，如 Auto-WEKA、Auto-sklearn 的核心优化器。</p>\n<h2 id=\"异步-smbo-与通信模式\">异步 SMBO 与通信模式</h2><p>标准 SMBO 是同步的：必须等待 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(\\mathbf{x}_t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 返回后才能拟合新模型。这在分布式评估环境中效率低下——如果一个 trial 耗时特别长，所有并行 worker 都在等它。</p>\n<p><strong>异步 SMBO 模式</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><p><strong>幻想观测（fantasized observations）</strong>：对正在运行的 trial，用 GP 后验的条件采样生成虚拟结果，然后正常优化 q-EI。BoTorch 的 <code>qNoisyExpectedImprovement</code> 支持此模式。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>Constant Liar</strong>：对正在运行的 trial 假设结果为某个常数（最优值/中位数/最差值），然后忽略这些虚拟点的不确定性继续优化 EI。Optuna 的 <code>n_jobs &gt; 1</code> 默认使用此策略。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>独立子研究（independent sub-studies）</strong>：每个 worker 维护自己的 GP 和 EI，定期同步数据。简单但可能导致重复评估。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"收敛诊断与预算分配\">收敛诊断与预算分配</h2><p>如何判断 SMBO 是否已经&quot;收敛&quot;（即继续迭代的边际收益极小）？</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>EI 值衰减</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi></msub><mtext>EI</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\max_\\mathbf{x} \\text{EI}(\\mathbf{x})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1611em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathbf mtight\">x</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">EI</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 持续下降到接近零</li>\n<li><strong>最优值稳定</strong>：连续 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 轮的最优观测值变化小于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li><strong>模型不确定性收缩</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi></msub><mi>σ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\max_\\mathbf{x} \\sigma(\\mathbf{x})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1611em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathbf mtight\">x</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 持续减小</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Optuna 支持通过 <code>study.stop()</code> API 根据自定义回调实现自适应停止。Ax 的 Scheduler 提供 <code>early_stopping_strategy</code> 配合收敛诊断。</p>\n<h2 id=\"smbo-的局限性与演化\">SMBO 的局限性与演化</h2><p>标准 SMBO 的主要局限：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>冷启动</strong>：前 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 步纯随机，浪费预算——<a href=\"tree-parzen-estimators\">TPE/BOHB</a> 通过先验知识和多保真度缓解</li>\n<li><strong>高维困难</strong>：GP 在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d &gt; 20</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span></span></span></span></span> 时建模能力退化——<a href=\"../foundations/exploration-exploitation\">TuRBO</a> 的信赖域方法局部化建模</li>\n<li><strong>评估代价均一假设</strong>：标准 SMBO 假设每次评估等价——<a href=\"multi-fidelity-methods\">多保真度方法</a>打破此假设</li>\n<li><strong>无先验信息利用</strong>：不利用历史任务经验——元学习（meta-learning）SMBO 通过迁移先验改善</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这些局限催生了本章后续文档讨论的算法族：TPE 解决高维和条件空间问题，多保真度方法解决评估代价不均问题。它们不是 SMBO 的替代品，而是 SMBO 框架内不同组件的替换和增强。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>SMBO 将代理模型和采集函数组装成完整的优化循环——概念简单但工程细节丰富。初始化质量、模型更新频率、采集函数优化精度和异步协调模式都显著影响最终效果。EGO 是连续低维场景的经典实现，SMAC 将其推广到高维混合空间。标准 SMBO 的冷启动、高维困难和均一评估代价假设催生了 TPE/BOHB 和多保真度等后续算法。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"序贯模型优化（SMBO）","id":"序贯模型优化-smbo"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"SMBO 的主循环结构","id":"smbo-的主循环结构"},{"level":2,"text":"初始化策略","id":"初始化策略"},{"level":2,"text":"代理模型的拟合与更新","id":"代理模型的拟合与更新"},{"level":2,"text":"采集函数优化的工程细节","id":"采集函数优化的工程细节"},{"level":2,"text":"SMBO 变体：EGO 与 SMAC","id":"smbo-变体-ego-与-smac"},{"level":2,"text":"异步 SMBO 与通信模式","id":"异步-smbo-与通信模式"},{"level":2,"text":"收敛诊断与预算分配","id":"收敛诊断与预算分配"},{"level":2,"text":"SMBO 的局限性与演化","id":"smbo-的局限性与演化"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"探索与利用平衡","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/bayesian-optimization-hyperparameter/foundations/exploration-exploitation"},"next":{"title":"TPE 与 BOHB","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/bayesian-optimization-hyperparameter/algorithms/tree-parzen-estimators"}}